{
  "_note": "今天(11,68×60,card-design-system §8.2):别名 / 今天这一格的状态词 / 第几天。状态与 mini / today 逐字同义(w.df 的 stKind:1 已记 · 2 记为未服 · 3 还没记 · 4 停药期 · 0 未开始);状态词刻意都是 2 个汉字 / ≤ 4 个英文字母,20pt 在 54pt 里放得下,所以字号恒 20、不需要流给 vf。\n手写产物;取数复用 flow/w.df,零新增键。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFB\\,#EDF7F4)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161A1D\\,#192021)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "8pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#128F66|#6FE8BE",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "17pt",
        "y": "7pt",
        "w": "43pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${alias},${@i18n.defaultAlias})]",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hasPlan},1),if::(eq::(${stKind},1),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "st1",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "22pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "${@i18n.w1}",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#128F66|#6FE8BE"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hasPlan},1),if::(eq::(${stKind},2),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "st2",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "22pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "${@i18n.w2}",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#A0A2A8"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hasPlan},1),if::(eq::(${stKind},3),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "st3",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "22pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "${@i18n.w3}",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hasPlan},1),if::(eq::(${stKind},4),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "st4",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "22pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "${@i18n.w4}",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#A0A2A8"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "未设置计划 / 计划未开始:值位「--」,不写「打开设置起始日」那类说明(card-design-system §5 / §8)。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hasPlan},1),if::(eq::(${stKind},0),1,0),1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "stE",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "28pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hasPlan},1),if::(eq::(${future},1),0,1),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "foot",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "$[connect::(${@i18n.dayPre},${todayNo},${@i18n.dayPost})]",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hasPlan},1),if::(eq::(${future},1),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "foot",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "${@i18n.notStarted}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "底行的「--」同样下移 0.3×字号,落回 9pt 字的墨迹中线。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hasPlan},1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "footE",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "8pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "54pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${hasPlan},-1),0),${@i18n.setup},--)]",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "_note": "还没设起始日时底行说动作(2026-10-08);取不到数仍是「--」。"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "defaultAlias": "每日记录",
        "w1": "已记",
        "w2": "未服",
        "w3": "待记",
        "w4": "休息",
        "dayPre": "第 ",
        "dayPost": " 天",
        "notStarted": "未开始",
        "setup": "点开设置"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "defaultAlias": "Doses",
        "w1": "Done",
        "w2": "Skip",
        "w3": "Due",
        "w4": "Off",
        "dayPre": "Day ",
        "dayPost": "",
        "notStarted": "Not started",
        "setup": "Tap to set"
      }
    },
    "i18nEmptyOk": [
      "dayPost"
    ]
  }
}
